Description: Provides an R-native, release-aware interface to the Allen Brain
    Cell (ABC) Atlas <https://brain-map.org/bkp/explore/abc-atlas>.
    Discovers supported dataset routes, assembles validated cell and gene
    metadata, selects exact or sampled cell populations, plans expression
    requests before transfer, and reads selected H5AD expression directly in
    R. Expression can be returned as a sparse matrix bundle, a
    SingleCellExperiment, or a SpatialExperiment object. The package
    preserves source representation and provenance, distinguishes raw counts
    from upstream transformed or imputed expression, and requires no Python
    installation. Atlas files are downloaded on first use and cached
    locally, so an internet connection is needed the first time each file
    is accessed.
